hanjustify — NOTICE
===================

This project is a derivative work. It is not a fork in the sense of modifying the
upstream algorithm: the Knuth-Plass line-breaking engine is used **unmodified**, and
the entire contribution is a new item model for CJK text plus the surrounding tooling.

