Third-party runtime dependency
------------------------------
  linebreak 1.1.0 — MIT — https://github.com/foliojs/linebreak
    Implements UAX #14 (Unicode Line Breaking Algorithm). Used for break
    opportunities only; all CJK-specific decisions are made in src/cjk/segment.mjs.
    Its transitive dependencies (unicode-trie, base64-js) are MIT.

  esbuild — MIT — build-time only, used to bundle the demo page.

Standards and specifications referenced
---------------------------------------
  UAX #14  Unicode Line Breaking Algorithm — https://unicode.org/reports/tr14/
  clreq    Requirements for Chinese Text Layout (W3C) — https://www.w3.org/TR/clreq/
  GB/T 15834—2011 《标点符号用法》

The character lists in src/cjk/kinsoku.mjs are derived from those specifications, not
copied from any implementation. Section references appear inline next to the rules they
justify.
